{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39581","headline":"奉使封闽王归京洛 · 翁承赞","name":"奉使封闽王归京洛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泥缄紫诰御恩光，信马嘶风出洛阳。\n此去愿言归梓里，预凭魂梦展维桑。\n客程回首瞻文陛，驿路乘轺忆故乡。\n指日还家堪自重，恩荣昼锦贺封王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39581.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39581","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}